    "%1$@ talks to your G6 or Dexcom ONE transmitter directly. It starts and stops sensor sessions, sends your calibrations, and fills in readings it missed.": {
      "comment": "Introduction: what the native driver does (1: app name)",
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
