      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Calibrations must be between %1$@ and %2$@. If your meter reads outside that range, treat it and follow your care team's guidance instead of calibrating.": {
      "comment": "Validation message for out-of-range calibration (1: minimum with unit, 2: maximum with unit)",
      "extractionState": "manual"
