    "Modified transmitters can keep a sensor running past the standard 10 days. This setting only changes when this app treats the session as finished; it does not change the sensor's accuracy. Sensor readings can drift the longer a sensor is worn, so check against a fingerstick meter if a reading does not match how you feel.": {
      "comment": "Footer explaining extended session length and its accuracy caveat",
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
