    "Place the applicator flat against your skin — horizontally, not upright — and press down firmly.": {
      "comment": "Insert step 6 body",
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Poorly washed hands are behind most inaccurate meter readings, and an inaccurate reading teaches the sensor the wrong thing.": {
      "comment": "Calibration step 1 note",
