    "Take a blood sample from your fingertip and measure it with your meter.": {
      "comment": "Calibration step 2 body",
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Take out the applicator whose sensor code you entered, and peel off its cover.": {
      "comment": "Insert step 4 body",
